      "subject": "malatsa a šupa le a šupa — lesomenne",
      "rationale": "Palo ya malatsa a mokete: šupa + šupa = lesomenne, e bidišitšwe gabedi ka ge Seheberu se bolla ka go boela."
    },
    {
      "kind": "measurement",
      "subject": "go tloga Hamathe go fihla molokote wa Metsrayime",
      "rationale": "Meelo ya setšhaba — go tsena go Hamathe go fihla molokote wa Metsrayime."
    },
    {
      "kind": "idiom",
      "subject": "מלבוא חמת",
      "rationale": "Go tsena ga Hamathe — lefelo la go tsena (Lebo-Hamate) goba toropokgolo ya Hamathe; ba fetoleli ba fapana."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Moya ge a šomiša: ge e le ka nako yeo Shelomo o ile a dira ⟨את⟩ mokete, gomme Yisraele ka moka le ene, phuthego e kgolo, go tloga go tsena go Hamathe go fihla go molokote wa Metsrayime, ka pele ga Yahwe Elohim wa rena, malatsa a šupa le malatsa a šupa — malatsa a lesomenne.",
